Changes made in this fork (November 2026, versions 5.0.0 - 5.2.2; details in INTEGRATION.md and the
git history):

- custom_components/nspanel_lovelace_ui: new native Home Assistant integration. Its backend/ folder is
  derived from the add-on's mqtt-manager backend (nspanel-lovelace-ui/rootfs/usr/bin/mqtt-manager) and
  was changed to run inside Home Assistant (in-process bridge instead of the websocket, Home Assistant
  MQTT, config flow, update entity, firmware download, migration helpers, fixes).
- HMI/nspanel.HMI, HMI/nspanel.tft: EU display firmware 55 (MDI 7 icon fonts, colour weather
  pictures, screensaver and notification changes). HMI/code_gen/: font, icon, picture and patch
  generators. HMI/patches/55: prepared event code for the US variants.
- tasmota/autoexec.be, tasmota/nsp-lovelace-driver.tapp: Berry driver 10 (flash progress and errors).
- scripts/, tests_ha/, MIGRATION*.md, INTEGRATION*.md, README*.md, CLAUDE.md: new or rewritten.
- Removed (5.2.2): the AppDaemon app (apps/, appdaemon/), the add-on (nspanel-lovelace-ui/; its
  panels.yaml.example moved to examples/panels.yaml), ioBroker/, ip-symcon/, nodered/, docs/,
  docs-standalone/, tests/ and their workflows. They remain in the original project and the git history.
- .github/workflows/nextion2text.yml: write permission for the regenerated dumps.

